{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大艾伯塔省周一（19日）舉行投票，根據初步點票結果，支持艾伯塔省繼續留在加拿大聯邦內的選民遠遠超過獨派，為總理卡尼（Mark Carney）在應對美國貿易戰及邊境緊張局勢之際帶來急需的政治勝利。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.051938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:40:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:37.072204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684287+00:00","content_hash":"9ea0e5d918d05810c26e9619a46d591b203fde1dba74737ae7dbec6b61c692bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}